File name: e3b-get-app.png. Landscape, exactly 1536 x 1024. References: refs/desktop-setup.jpg and refs/desktop-groups.jpg for style.
Screen: the extension's welcome page, step 3 of 5, when Off Grid AI is not found on this computer. Centred column.
Mono label "OFF GRID AI · IN YOUR BROWSER". Title "Get Off Grid AI for your computer". Muted line "Your picks run on your computer, so chats and pages never leave it. It takes about two minutes."
A glass card with a computer line icon, text "Off Grid AI for Mac, Windows and Linux", the emerald primary button "Get Off Grid AI", and beside it a quiet outline button "I have it, look again".
Below the card, small muted text "Using another computer on your network? Set its address" where "Set its address" is a quiet link.
Footer: 5-segment progress, segment 3 active, mono step name "CONNECT". Right: text button "Back".
